MolmoSpaces is an open leaderboard for robot policies. Congratulations to @NVIDIARobotics on holding the top spot. Anyone can submit a policy and try to beat it.

@NVIDIARobotics' Cosmos 3 wins another leaderboard, demonstrating the power of an open frontier model. A policy model post-trained on Cosmos 3 Nano shows the strongest performance in environments that require models to interpret, reason, and act in real time, not just understanding the world but interacting with it.

Drop what you're building in the comments.
